 "provenance": "Angkor 4 (w0 l3) normal exit. Start values are the record of the New Game campaign chain at Angkor 4 (intro, then the certified Angkor 1-3 routes, carrying the record between stages as in tests/campaign-chain.test.ts; replayed with work/claude2/a4-chain.ts): lives 8, campaign diamonds 27, redDiamonds 0, maxHealth 4, weaponTier 0 (the hammer is obtained in this stage from the chest at 26,18). Campaign diamonds do not affect this stage: the magic lock counts stage diamonds, and the outcome is identical with start diamonds 0, 21 or 27. Ticks 0-1572 are the prefix of the old certified route (attempts/prepaint-0-angkor-04-hammer-normal.json), unchanged and without deaths: stones on the plates 5,21 and 12,20 open gates 0 and 1, checkpoints 3,17 / 8,8 / 18,5, the 5-diamond chest 14,9 and the red-diamond chest 12,9 from the row-8 corridor, the upper diamond cluster, the health chest 19,9, the combat room (stone 17,12 pushed onto the cut grass column 16 and 15,13 cut so both stones fall on the two snakes), checkpoints 18,14 and 18,19, then the hammer chest 26,18 (weaponTier 1, picked up at t=1390) and its dialogue 22 (opens at t=1430). Rebuilt on the corrected harness (logic+paint per frame): dismisses dialogue 22 with action presses (t=1596); hammers bricks 31-32,19, 32,16-17 and 32,12 (31,12 crumbles with it; diamonds 32,13-15) to checkpoint 29,12; bricks 26-27,12 and 22-24,12 (diamond 25,12); climbs column 21 through the two flame throwers (19,10 and 18,8) in their idle phase without damage; bricks 23-24,5 (23-24,4 crumble with them) and 24,6 to checkpoint 25,6; opens the health chest 25,8; bricks 27-29,7 (27,8 crumbles with them, so stone 27,6 drops to 27,8), diamond 29,8; crosses column 32 on row 7 while the red snake patrolling 32,7-32,8 is down at 32,8; climbs 33,7-33,5; stuns the snake stuck at 34,5 with the hammer (t=2299) and walks past it (t=2311; stunned enemies do not hurt, method_325), through the magic diamond lock 36,5 (27 stage diamonds >= 25, field_156 25 -> -2) to the exit 37,5 (object 5) at t=2354. Control-only (direction/action only, no resets), no deaths. Played from the chain record the campaign continues with lives 9, diamonds 54, redDiamonds 1, weaponTier 1.",
